Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:19.01,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.40,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:30.47,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:31.32,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
